/**
 * Deterministic "demo mode" analysis engine.
 *
 * It runs when no AI provider key is configured. Every output it produces is
 * explicitly labelled `mode: "demo"` so the UI can state plainly that the
 * result was generated by the offline rules engine rather than by a model.
 * The scoring is fully deterministic: the same answers always yield the same
 * profile, and different answers yield different profiles.
 */

